🟢 5. LOAD BALANCER FAILURE
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Single LB:

Client
  ↓
LB ❌
  ↓
Servers

→ LB becomes SPOF.

Solution:
→ Redundant / highly available Load Balancers.

Core rule:
→ Critical components should not become single points of failure.


